        "text": "Balancing a state budget annually reflects responsible fiscal management.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Federal deficits should ideally be minimized or avoided when possible.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Members of Congress from fiscally conservative states are expected to oppose large increases in the national debt.",
